                        "username": "geissonator"
                    },
                    "message": "I remember back when the project started we were encouraged to avoid libraries but I think that was mostly to avoid putting in external interfaces to other repos (and to instead use dbus). Adding a few other reviewers in case I'm forgetting something."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Static libraries within a repository are fine as long as they aren't \"installed\" (and yocto would strip them out anyhow if they were).  This example is just used as a build performance optimization."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "I believe the static lib will not be installed by default\n\nhttps://mesonbuild.com/Reference-manual_functions.html#static_library_install"
                }
            ],
